.SH Platform support
The C# binding supports:
.IP \(bu 2
\f[B]Linux\f[R] \(en Unix domain sockets via \f[CR]Socket\f[R] +
\f[CR]UnixDomainSocketEndPoint\f[R] (.NET 6+).
.IP \(bu 2
\f[B]macOS\f[R] \(en Same as Linux.
.IP \(bu 2
\f[B]Windows\f[R] \(en Named Pipes via \f[CR]NamedPipeClientStream\f[R].
Unix sockets also work on Windows 10+ with AF_UNIX support.
.IP \(bu 2
\f[B]Cygwin\f[R] \(en Named Pipe transport recommended for interop with
Cygwin bash\-server.
